#ASSERT `the maximum fine in dollars` `influencing a Commission under section 6` EQUALS 2000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `false information under section 2` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `unauthorised disclosure under section 4(1)` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `onward publication under section 4(2)` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `influencing a Commission under section 6` EQUALS 24

